flowchart TD
  Start[Start offense] --> Known{Alliance and HUB state known?}
  Known -->|No| Wait[Wait for match state]
  Wait --> Known
  Known -->|Yes| Collect[Collect observed fuel]
  Collect --> Choose{Strategy chooses}
  Choose -->|HUB active| Return[Return to shot position]
  Return --> Ready{HUB active and arrival settled?}
  Ready -->|Yes| Score[Attempt HUB shot]
  Ready -->|No| Retry[Wait or retry]
  Choose -->|HUB inactive| Ferry[Attempt ferry shot]
  Score --> Known
  Ferry --> Known
  Retry --> Known
